 *             as a base for blocks with hazards.
 *         </li>
 *     </ul>
 * </p>
 *
 * <h2>Examples</h2>
 *
 * <pre>
 * {@code
 * // Create 0-2-1-R hazard data
 * HazardData data = HazardDiamondAPI.data(
